            }
          ],
          "correctValue": null,
          "solution": {
            "text": "Ortho and para hydrogen similar to each other in their chemical properties but they have different physical properties like boiling point, thermal conductivity, due to their difference in overall spins.\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/bitsat/zOcmN1xViz_LzG6vg-f0HQRokroV91AmS1RAeR-HOeQ.original.fullsize.png\"><br>",
