            "image": null
          },
          "options": [
            {
              "id": "qOCdv",
              "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>CH</mi><mn>4</mn></msub><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></mfenced><mo>+</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></mfenced><munderover><mo>&#8594;</mo><mi>Ni</mi><mrow><mn>1270</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi></mrow></munderover><mi>CO</mi><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></mfenced><mo>+</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></mfenced></math>",
              "isCorrect": false,
              "image": null
            },
            {
              "id": "QUJqI",
              "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>CO</mi><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></mfenced><mo>+</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></mfenced><munderover><mo>&#8594;</mo><mi>Catalyst</mi><mrow><mn>673</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi></mrow></munderover><msub><mi>CO</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></mfenced><mo>+</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></mfenced></math>",
              "isCorrect": false,
              "image": null
            },
            {
              "id": "s2fZk",
              "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mo>.</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></mfenced><munderover><mo>&#8594;</mo><mi>Ni</mi><mrow><mn>1270</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi></mrow></munderover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mo>.</mo><mi>CO</mi><mo>+</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math>",
              "isCorrect": false,
              "image": null
            },
            {
              "id": "3u8vI",
              "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>CO</mi><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></mfenced><munderover><mo>&#8594;</mo><mi>Catalyst</mi><mi>Cobalt</mi></munderover><msub><mi>CH</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>&#183;</mo><mi>OH</mi><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi></mfenced></math>",
              "isCorrect": true,
              "image": null
            }
          ],
          "correctValue": null,
          "solution": {
            "text": "<p>The mixture of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>CO</mi><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></mfenced></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></mfenced></math> is known water gas as it is used in the synthesis of other compounds.</p><p>When carbon monoxide reacts with hydrogen in presence of catalyst cobalt&nbsp;the product formed is&nbsp;methanol. Therefore, water gas is producing a an alcohol in this reaction.</p><p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/bitsat/6803a5b7-299e-41c6-9ec2-3050566c05b1-image.png\" style=\"width: 481px; height: 131px;\" /></p>",
